      "settings": {
        "page-id": "home_garden",
        "border_bottom": false,
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0,
        "img_green": "shopify://shop_images/Group_1.png",
        "title": "HOME & GARDEN",
        "detail": "Brings Wood Back To Life.",
        "content": "<p>Ballistol lubricates anything that squeaks or binds, including locks, hinges, sliding doors, windows, fans, moving parts in AC units, faucets and gardening tools like scissors, sickles, hatch-trimmers, weed-wackers, lawn connections, chain saws, and more. In addition, Ballistol maintains, protects, preserves and rejuvenates unpainted wooden surfaces. It regenerates natural wood and brings out the wood grain, and helps antique furniture and old, dry, dull wood regain its natural silky glow. Ballistol also protects wood against damage resulting from humidity and insects. It’s also great for cleaning, rejuvenating and preserving metal and plastic tools from screwdrivers, wrenches, knives and pliers to drills, clippers, sanders and saws. Tired of snow sticking to your shovel? Spray it with Ballistol and problem solved.</p>",
        "content_position_top": false,
        "video_content": "",
        "enable_video_looping": false,
